                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Excellent old school ball and paddle game, with frantic gameplay and Unreal Engine 4 technology. Very good tutorial, with well though out difficulty curve. Crazy level design, with added physics based levels, as a topping on a very sweet experience. A very welcome gaming addition, amongst the same ol' shoot this, upgrade that, run for your life gaming that's been going on forever. Can't wait for what's coming next from this dev.",
